BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Game info (luaui/widgets/gui_gameinfo.lua): the window no wider than the screen
(docs/upstream/bar-windows-upright.patch, written for BAR: its scale is the screen's height over 1080, so upright it was
about twice the width of the screen, its right side cut off). Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as
LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file runs.

@@@ find
local widgetScale = (vsy / 1080)
@@@ with
local widgetScale = math.min(vsy / 1080, vsx / (screenWidthOrg + 50)) -- BAR Droid (phone; docs/upstream/bar-windows-upright.patch): no wider than the screen
@@@ end

